SUMMARY:Latinos & Latinas Run Club
DESCRIPTION:Come connect with us over a run! \nHosted by Latinos Run and Latinas Run of Raleigh & Durham\, all paces and people are welcome weekly starting at 6:30pm. We’ll follow a 3–4 mile route through downtown Durham before returning to us here at Glass Jug Downtown for drinks and camaraderie. \nLatinos Run and Latinas Run are nationwide running organizations dedicated to empowering and connecting communities through running\, wellness\, and culture. Their mission is to create a supportive\, inclusive space where individuals of all backgrounds and fitness levels feel welcomed and encouraged to move their bodies and build meaningful connections. You can learn more about the organizations here: https://www.latinasrunclub.com/ and https://www.latinosrun.com/ \nAfter each run\, we’re welcoming you inside the taproom for Game Night starting at 7:30pm. We’ve got plenty of board and card games for you to choose from as well as our Nintendo64 so come ready for some friendly competition. \nWe aim to be a welcoming space for all runners to connect\, move\, and enjoy each other’s company – so join us\, Latinos Run\, and Latinas Run every Thursday! \nView on Facebook.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/latinos-latinas-run-club-2/2026-10-08/
LOCATION:The Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Sports
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/165924-Latinos-Latinas-Run-Club.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Glass Jug Beer Lab - Downtown Durham":MAILTO:marketing@glass-jug.com
GEO:36.0014902;-78.9018252
