SUMMARY:Open Studio: Glass & Other
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and create on your own terms! Your Open Studio Day Pass gives you access to Fusion Gallery’s shared studio space from 1:00 PM–7:00 PM on your selected day. Come in anytime after 1:00 PM and stay as late as 7:00 PM. \nUse our studio space and tools or bring your own project to work on; perfect for artists who don’t have a home studio or simply want dedicated time and space to make. Personal cubbies are also available to store works-in-progress between visits. \nOnline registration or sign-up via email is required before coming in. Drop-ins are not permitted at this time. If you’d like to come in at a time you don’t see available online\, email us at info@fusionnc.com. \nHow Open Studio Works\nOpen Studio is self-guided and does not include instruction. You should already have the skills needed to safely work in your chosen medium. It’s also a great opportunity to finish projects started during a Fusion class. \nYour Day Pass includes access to our shared workspace\, tools\, equipment\, and currently available non-consumable materials. Consumable and specialty materials are charged separately based on usage. \nStained & Fused Glass\nPrior stained or fused glass experience is required to use our glass tools. Taking a basics or beginner class at Fusion is recommended\, but previous instruction at Carolina Stained Glass or Say It With Glass is also accepted. \n• Glass\, solder\, foil\, and frit: $35/lb\n• Bringing your own stained glass? Foil and solder use: $6\n• Paper stained glass patterns: Free\n• Vinyl-cut patterns: $3 each\n• An assortment of stained glass patterns is available for studio use\n• Kiln firings are handled by Fusion staff only \nSilver Clay\nPrior silver clay experience is required to use silver clay tools. Taking a beginner class at Fusion is recommended before using the studio independently. \n• Silver clay: $7/gram prior to firing\n• Firing of your completed piece is included and will be completed at the convenience of Fusion studio staff\n• Guests may not fire their own pieces without prior authorization from Fusion’s owners \nDrawing & Painting\nNo prior class or experience is required for drawing or painting. Your Open Studio fee includes access to currently available shared drawing and painting materials. \nPlease Note\n• Day Pass access is valid 1:00 PM–7:00 PM on your selected date only\n• Online or email registration is required before arriving—no walk-ins\n• Open Studio is self-guided and does not include instruction\n• Some specialty tools\, equipment\, or processes may require prior approval or demonstrated experience\n• Guests are responsible for cleaning their workspace and helping maintain a respectful shared environment\n• Misuse of the space\, tools\, or equipment or failure to follow studio guidelines may result in removal from the studio without refund
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/open-studio-glass-other-2/2026-10-10/1/
LOCATION:Fusion Gallery\, 321 W Main St\, Durham\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3425.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Fusion Gallery":MAILTO:FusionGalleryNC@gmail.com
GEO:36.0000517;-78.9017396
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Fusion Gallery 321 W Main St Durham 27701 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=321 W Main St:geo:-78.9017396,36.0000517
END:VEVENT
