SUMMARY:Southern Doc Fest
DESCRIPTION:Southern Doc Fest is a one-day celebration of Southern documentary storytelling taking place October 10\, 2026\, at the Durham Arts Council. Join Southern Documentary Fund for powerful feature documentaries\, a curated Reel South Shorts Block\, filmmaker conversations\, and a live musical performance\, all celebrating the stories\, people\, and communities that make the South unique.
