SUMMARY:Explore Your Inner Artist with Adam Narcross
DESCRIPTION:Explore Your Inner Artist with Adam Narcross of Narcross Arts! \nTap into your creativity and discover your own artistic style in this welcoming painting class led by oil painter Adam Narcross of Narcross Arts. Using acrylic paint on canvas\, Adam will guide you through the painting process while encouraging you to experiment\, trust your instincts\, and make the piece your own. \nRather than focusing on creating a “perfect” painting\, this class is about exploring color and composition.
