SUMMARY:Good Moon Festival – Sylvan Esso With Silvana Estrada
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to announce the return of GOOD MOON. After taking a year away we are back and in a new phase. \nGood Moon 2026 will be anchored by three nights of music at DPAC\, Oct 8-10. Sylvan Esso will play two of those nights\, and our dear friend Tyler Childers will play the other. Also joining them at DPAC will be the legendary Meshell Ndegeocello\, aja monet\, and Silvana Estrada. \nFollowing the sets at DPAC\, we invite everyone to join us for more shows and afterparties at The Pinhook\, Boom Club\, and Bay 7. \nThe only way to access to all of these performances is to secure a VIP weekend pass\, of which there are very limited supplies. Once those are completely sold out we will begin offering tickets to each individual show\, starting with the concerts at DPAC.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/good-moon-festival-sylvan-esso-with-silvana-estrada/
LOCATION:DPAC Presented by First Horizon\, 123 Vivian St / William V. "Bill" Bell Way\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Concert,Festival,Music
