SUMMARY:Crank Arm Karaoke
DESCRIPTION:Crank Arm Karaoke is free to attend and super low-key. If a song is in the Karafun catalogue\, you can sing it! Costs nothing to attend\, sing\, or just hang out and support the folks who do sing! Saturday at 7pm is a perfect start time for folks who like to be in soft clothes by a certain hour! It goes until 10pm\, so nite owls can hit the town afterward!
