SUMMARY:This is How Your Soul Will Transition: A book signing and workshop experience
DESCRIPTION:A Tarot Meditation for greeting Death and journeying to what’s next. \nJoin Jenna Matlin for a guided meditation and tarot process exploring your own transition journey. All tarot levels welcome. Bring a deck if you have\, but it’s not required. \nAfterward\, Jenna will be signing copies of her latest book\, The Tarot Book of the Dead\, included with your workshop ticket. \nSunday\, October 11th 11:00-12:30pm
