SUMMARY:Hand-Built Dishes & Ashtrays · Oct 11
DESCRIPTION:Every good hangout has an object at the center of it — the ashtray\, the catch-all\, the dish that holds the rings and the matchbooks. Drawn From™: Friday is a hand-building pop-up from EarthenTide Studios\, hosted at Redhead Hemp Canna Cafe. Over approximately two hours\, you’ll build one or two vessels — small to medium\, your choice — with instructors coaching throughout\, then select your glaze from the EarthenTide palette. All materials are included; beginners are welcome; 21+. RSVP to save your seat! Your finished pieces will be fired and returned to you in four to five weeks.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/hand-built-dishes-ashtrays-%c2%b7-oct-11/
