SUMMARY:Trivia Night @ DSSOLVR (w/ Hammered Trivia - FREE & Dog Friendly!)
DESCRIPTION:Every Tuesday at DSSOLVR\, starting @ 7 pm. Free to play\, no team limits\, prizes for top 3 teams. $6 IPAs & $1 Jell-o Shots. Dog friendly! \nJoin us every Tuesday @ 7 pm for mind-melting trivia sessions hosted by Ansley w/ Hammered Trivia (Thunder question set for those who play multiple Hammered Trivia locations). This is your shot to flex all that brainpower and have a gnarly time while you’re at it. Free to play – bring your whole crew! \nPlus\, enjoy $6 IPAs & $1 Jell-o Shots all day long! SICK PRIZES! RAD BREWS! EPIC VIBES Y’ALL!! \nDSSOLVR Info: \nWi-Fi – Free guest Wi-Fi available.\nMenu – Menu has rotating options of beer\, liquor/cocktails\, cider\, Gluten free beers\, hard ginger beer\, Jell-O shots\, and extensive non-alcoholic offerings!TVs – 4 TVs – request to put on any game or show!\nDogs – Dog Friendly inside taproom & outside on covered patio (we have toys\, beds\, & water bowls!)\nFamily – Family friendly w/ high chair\, changing table\, and sensory toys for kids.\nGames – Free to play board games\, N64\, NES\, and arcade games\nFood – Snacks & cup of noodles available on site. Several food delivery & carry out options available within a 2 block radius.\nParking – Standard downtown parking options available. Street parking all around (free after 7 pm and on Sat/Sun. Free gravel parking lot next to Welcome tattoo. Free parking along residential streets back towards Durty Bull. Paid parking lots in Liberty Apartment building and next to Geer House Apartments.
